---
import Tree from "./vectors/Tree.astro";
import N2 from "./vectors/N2.astro";
import Doma from "./vectors/Doma.astro";
---

<section aria-labelledby="detailed-feature-title" class="bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center sm:mb-20">
      <h2 id="detailed-feature-title" class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Designed around the way systems develop
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        Start with the structure, add interfaces and keep related engineering
        information available as the project evolves.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-20 sm:space-y-28 lg:space-y-32">
      <section aria-labelledby="tree-feature-title" class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
        <div role="img" aria-label="Tree view showing a hierarchical system structure" class="w-full">
          <Tree />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h3 id="tree-feature-title" class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Break down and classify systems
          </h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            Create object structures and reference designations based on the
            RDS 81346 approach.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="n2-feature-title" class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
        <div role="img" aria-label="N2 diagram showing system dependencies and interfaces" class="w-full md:order-2">
          <N2 />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h3 id="n2-feature-title" class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Map integrations and interfaces
          </h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            Give engineering teams a clearer overview of dependencies and N2
            style interface structures.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="doma-feature-title" class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
        <div role="img" aria-label="Domain Relations (DOMA) diagram showing connections between aspect types and engineering domains" class="w-full">
          <Doma />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h3 id="doma-feature-title" class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Connect related domains
          </h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            Keep relations between aspect types and engineering domains tied to
            the same source of project context.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
